  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"1997-03-24T07:19:00Z\"\u003e24 March 1997\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  LUXTON REAPPOINTS CHAIRPERSON OF COPYRIGHT TRIBUNAL\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        John Luxton\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Commerce and Industry\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Minister of Commerce, the Hon John Luxton, announced an appointment to the Copyright Tribunal today. Judge AE Gaskell has been reappointed as Chairperson for a period of five years. Her appointment will take effect from 28 September 1996. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
